[{"answer":"Now that we've done all the research into bike-sharing schemes in cities around the world,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/1.mp3"},{"answer":"we need to think about how we're going to organise our report.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I think we should start by talking about the benefits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean it's great that so many cities have introduced these schemes","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/5.mp3"},{"answer":"where anyone can pick up a bike from dozens of different locations","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/6-2023-07-28-21-33-10.mp3"},{"answer":"and hire it for a few hours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/7.mp3"},{"answer":"It makes riding a bike very convenient for people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but the costs can add up","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/9.mp3"},{"answer":"and that puts people on low incomes off in some places.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose so,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/11.mp3"},{"answer":"but if it means more people in general are cycling rather than driving,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/12.mp3"},{"answer":"then because they're increasing the amount of physical activity they do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/13-2023-12-05-22-20-00.mp3"},{"answer":"it's good for their health","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/14.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/15.mp3"},{"answer":"But isn't that of less importance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, doesn't the impact of reduced emissions on air pollution","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/17.mp3"},{"answer":"have a more significant effect on people's health?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly, in some cities bike-sharing has made a big contribution to that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/19.mp3"},{"answer":"And also helped to cut the number of cars on the road significantly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Which is the main point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/22.mp3"},{"answer":"But I'd say it's had less of an impact on noise pollution","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/23.mp3"},{"answer":"because there are still loads of buses and lorries around.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Shall we quickly discuss the recommendations we're going to make?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/26.mp3"},{"answer":"In order to ensure bike-sharing schemes are successful?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/28.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, while I think it's nice to have really state-of-the-art bikes with things like GPS,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't say they're absolutely necessary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/31.mp3"},{"answer":"But some technical things are really important -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/32.mp3"},{"answer":"like a fully functional app -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/33.mp3"},{"answer":"so people can make payments and book bikes easily.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Places which haven't invested in that have really struggled.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Good point...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/36-2023-12-07-19-29-36.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people say there shouldn't be competing companies offering separate bike-sharing schemes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/37.mp3"},{"answer":"but in some really big cities, competition's beneficial","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/38.mp3"},{"answer":"and anyway one company might not be able to manage the whole thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Deciding how much to invest is a big question.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Cities which have opened loads of new bike lanes","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/42.mp3"},{"answer":"at the same time as introducing bike-sharing schemes have generally been more successful -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/43.mp3"},{"answer":"but there are examples of successful schemes where this hasn't happened...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/44.mp3"},{"answer":"What does matter though - is having a big publicity campaign.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/46.mp3"},{"answer":"If people don't know how to use the scheme or don't understand its benefits,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/47.mp3"},{"answer":"they won't use it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/48-2023-12-12-18-00-33.mp3"},{"answer":"People need a lot of persuasion to stop using their cars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Shall we look at some examples now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/50.mp3"},{"answer":"And say what we think is good or bad about them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose we should start with Amsterdam","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/52.mp3"},{"answer":"as this was one of the first cities to have a bike-sharing scheme.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/54.mp3"},{"answer":"There was already a strong culture of cycling here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/55.mp3"},{"answer":"In a way it's strange that there was such a demand for bike-sharing","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/56.mp3"},{"answer":"because you'd have thought most people would have used their own bikes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/57.mp3"},{"answer":"And yet it's one of the best-used schemes...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Dublin's an interesting example of a success story.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/59.mp3"},{"answer":"It must be because the public transport system's quite limited.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Not really -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/61.mp3"},{"answer":"there's no underground, but there are trams and a good bus network.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd say price has a lot to do with it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/63.mp3"},{"answer":"It's one of the cheapest schemes in Europe to join.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/64.mp3"},{"answer":"But the buses are really slow -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/65.mp3"},{"answer":"anyway the weather certainly can't be a factor!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/66.mp3"},{"answer":"No - definitely not.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/67-2023-12-12-18-03-55.mp3"},{"answer":"The London scheme's been quite successful","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes - it's been a really good thing for the city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/69.mp3"},{"answer":"The bikes are popular and the whole system is well maintained","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/70.mp3"},{"answer":"but it isn't expanding quickly enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Basically, not enough's been spent on increasing the number of cycle lanes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Hopefully that'll change.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what about outside Europe?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Well bike-sharing schemes have taken off in places like Buenos Aires.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/76.mp3"},{"answer":"They built a huge network of cycle lanes to support the introduction of the scheme there, didn't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/77.mp3"},{"answer":"It attracted huge numbers of cyclists where previously there were hardly any.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/78.mp3"},{"answer":"An example of good planning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/80.mp3"},{"answer":"New York is a good example of how not to introduce a scheme.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/81.mp3"},{"answer":"When they launched it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/82.mp3"},{"answer":"it was more than ten times the price of most other schemes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/83.mp3"},{"answer":"More than it costs to take a taxi, crazy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/84.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the organisers lacked vision and ambition there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/85.mp3"},{"answer":"I think so too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Sydney would be a good example to use.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/87.mp3"},{"answer":"I would have expected it to have grown pretty quickly here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/89.mp3"},{"answer":"I can't quite work out why it hasn't been an instant success like some of the others.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/90.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a shame really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/91.mp3"},{"answer":"I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/92.mp3"},{"answer":"OK so now we've thought about...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-3-2023-01-06-22-59-44/93.mp3"}]
